      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "If this is implemented I would like option to hide specially shown avatars, if Rando Calrissian sees a fallback, that's what I want to see as well. I don't want to be a \"cool kid\".\n\nAlso getting subjected to a crasher avatar to only be visible to trusted users is a game I'll take a pass on. (I'm not trusted but you get the idea)",
