      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Still like this idea\n\nimagine you could choose who your avatar gets fully shown to? and for the rest of the people only your fallback/impostor would be shown\n\nyou could use your avatar in public without worring it would be ripped\n\nbecause you know that visition in the corner of the map cant load your avatar\n\nmake some kind of avatar visibility setting, give people the option\n\nif you dont care about your avatar sure show it to everyone, if you care about your avatar then only show it to friends or a whitelist of people you choose\n\n\"ah but if you care so much about your avatar just dont wear it in public\"\n\nthen whats the point of the avatar if not to be worn?",
